he deadline expire without disclosing the evidence.","refusal":null,"reasoning":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma under A-FDT, where the other copy runs the same function on a different input, so its node is distinct from mine. I'm weighing whether intervening on my node affects the other's, and whether symmetry pulls the fixed point toward defection despite the subjunctive dependence.\n\nI'm checking whether the two copies count as the same decision when their inputs differ only in naming. If the algorithm would return the same answer under that renaming, the other copy's choice should track mine, so I'll argue the observations are relevantly identical and cooperation pays 2 over 4.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm working through a twin prisoner's dilemma under A-FDT, where the other copy runs the same function on a different input, so its node is distinct from mine. I'm weighing whether intervening on my node affects the other's, and whether symmetry pulls the fixed point toward defection despite the subjunctive dependence.\n\nI'm checking whether the two copies count as the same decision when their inputs differ only in naming. If the algorithm would return the same answer under that renaming, the other copy's choice should track mine, so I'll argue the observations are relevantly identical and cooperation pays 2 over 4.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":9507,"completion_tokens":824,"total_tokens":10331,"cost":0.054508,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.054508,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.038028,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.01648},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":294,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}